chi.co/blogs/01JHZ3DWBXG1349KH1K571MH8Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症時用メガネ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"度あり分厚すぎメガネを、かけると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙人になってしまうので！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネの光の反射具合がすごくて、自撮りするのが難しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネだと誰かわからないね~*(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 最近の私出来事。~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーモンドの好きなところ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"微妙に一つ一つ味が違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーモンドの味一つ一つ噛み締めてたべるの良いですよね~。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーモンドって美味しいですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****************************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3DXRN0NJ95SMHG4786PA5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤味が強い気分の日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3DYQQCYCEN7JJT6BKAHTZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は家具を組み立てていました~。今日も家具を組み立てようと思います( ᐛ  )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビボードも以前組み立てて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は扉付きカラーボックスを！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは何しますか~？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****************************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「音楽の日2020」、私も見させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽が人に与える力、\n音を楽しむ事の大切さを改めて感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音を楽しむというのも色んな意味があると思います。\n音を心で楽しむのにもその時々で、色々な意味があって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと色々な楽しみ方を知って、行けたらいいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に夏の気分になれる「裸足でSummer」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ初披露だった「世界中の隣人よ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも、より、大好きで大切な曲だなと感じさせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なパフォーマンスでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の方の曲を歌っている、先輩方、4期生の方も澄んだ歌声が美しくて、素敵でした。\n好きな曲が増えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****************************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"~~~質問~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○B.L.T.と言えば、ベーコン・レタス・トマトですね！璃果ちゃんはブロッコリー・レタス・トマトですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.サンドってそういう意味だったんですね...初知りです( ˙_˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はBLTとえば、B.L.T.9月号さんでいっぱいです~~！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ お花を好きになったきっかけは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生花を調べようと思ったのは、ブログを書いていく中で、\n毎日違った何かを楽しみにして貰えたらいいな、今日という日にも意味があるという事を思いながら生きて行ければ素敵なんじゃないかな！と思ったからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前まではただ、お花、かわいいー！すきー！！という感じでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ 花柄のワンピースはどこのブランドのものですか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZARAさんです❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ どんなお花の香りが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いけど、清々しい香り︎︎︎︎︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも質問、コメント、ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****************************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はるなぴです。\n個人的にるなぴが前回、次回予告をしていた、\n明日のブログ、、\nとてもとても楽しみなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****************************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにとって今日が素敵な一日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から4日間、お休みの方もいるのでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも、心やすらぐ時間になりますように。\n(7月22日の誕生花の花言葉のひとつ。)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3DZVDFP37MGC0H1DZPG1B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3E0WXG0NQY96PNMGEW48C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ぱっつん気味です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(お湯が湧きました。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分けてるのとどちらが好きですか~？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。 "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#18 ♡ り か ♡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24336":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんおはようございます！\n新内眞衣です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回レインブーツの記事を書いた途端\n雨ばかりの日々で驚きを隠せません(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨女なのかな、私、、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\n最近のOL生活はというと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人事異動が本格化してきて、\n大量のお花が社内に溢れています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前を向いても胡蝶蘭。\n後ろを向いても胡蝶蘭。\n胡蝶蘭と共に仕事をしているのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく優雅な気持ちになります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、社会人の方はご存知かと\n思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胡蝶蘭は花言葉が\n【幸福の飛来・到来】という意味があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花として生命力が強く、\n2ヶ月以上綺麗な花を咲かせます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に鉢植えの花なので「根付く」\nという意味も込められ、\n長くその地に根付き、\n幸福がやってきますように\nという意味が込められているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくこういった時に贈られるみたいですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(上司に教えて貰いました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2カ月もお花に囲まれて\n生活出来るなんて幸せ〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月も頑張りましょう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELO発売中です♪"},{"type":"